d vehicle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step 3. Manage your pizzeria🏪</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/extras/0090cb1d820f4f64dd70bd46095a97cc.poster.avif?t=1762586772\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/extras/0090cb1d820f4f64dd70bd46095a97cc.webm?t=1762586772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/extras/0090cb1d820f4f64dd70bd46095a97cc.mp4?t=1762586772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There's a lot more to keep an eye on to make your store successful besides deliveries, including ratings, competitors who don't like pizza, upgrading base and vehicles, exploration, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you make your pizzeria successful in the zombie apocalypse? It's up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run a pizzeria in a zombie apocalypse and deliver pizzas to survivors! Survive day by day racing through the dangerous streets. Can you escape the fate? Selling a lot of pizzas is the only way.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/header.jpg?t=1762586772", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/b9bfb03d6cb7dce1f7c7ac73e23fe293060de6a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762586772", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937920/b9bfb03d6cb7dce1f7c7ac73e23fe293060de6a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762586772", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Re